		{
			"id": "eVIl1EU6EIgq08lWc",
			"description": "Tesla Destructor",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The heaviest personal-scale tesla weapon fielded by Necron forces, most associated in background material with the Annihilation Barge and Doom Scythe, answering a concentration of enemy infantry too large for a tesla cannon to saturate alone; treated throughout as the family's top tier rather than a distinct weapon in its own right.\n\nDesign: One further die up the same family progression the Tesla Cannon establishes over the Tesla Carbine (6dx3 at the unchanged (2) divisor): checked by exact dice distribution, 6dx3(2) averages 63 and penetrates carapace (DR 70, eff. 35) 99.0%, Astartes power armour (DR 100, eff. 50) 85.5%, and a Terminator (DR 200, eff. 100) 0.06% - a genuine Marine-killer on top of the family's arc saturation, the first tesla weapon to reach the gauss cannon's own power-armour threat level while keeping its signature multi-target arc. Handling: 45 lb and min ST 22B (sqrt(10x45)=21.2, bumped for the dense grip and given B since it is always crewed or braced); RoF 2, slower than the cannon's 3 for the bigger single discharge, and Shots 60(1800), the smallest reserve in the family at the same half-hour recharge for the biggest per-shot draw. Bulk -7 and Acc 6 sit at the top of the tesla bracket; Rcl 1 is unchanged.",
