		{
			"id": "eC92stOmcE7AcMTOK",
			"description": "Eldritch Lance",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A staff-mounted lance weapon carried by senior Crypteks, most associated in background material with anti-armour Cryptek loadouts and the eerie, focused beams the RPG-line Necron-armoury material and older Codex fluff describe drilling clean through a tank's glacis or a Terminator's plate with no apparent regard for how thick the armour is - distinct from a gauss weapon's molecular stripping, this is a beam that simply ignores matter in its path.\n\nDesign: Built on the same \"focused beam penetrates any armour to the same depth\" logic framework.md's Aeldari Bright Lance anchor establishes for that weapon's own divisor (100): no Necron anchor names this weapon by dice, but the lore's own \"drills through with no regard for thickness\" description is functionally the identical special effect, so this entry borrows that design principle rather than inventing a new one for what is, mechanically, the same kind of weapon. Checked by exact dice distribution: 6dx3(100) burn averages 63 and faces an effective DR of 0-4 from flak to AV14 and 13 against a Leman Russ's front or a Land Raider (DR 1350), penetrating all of them 100% of the time - the lore's beam that ignores the matter in its path, and a reliable tank-and-Terminator killer, though a lighter hit than the bright lance (average 63 against 84) for a staff weapon rather than a heavy one. Handling: 30 lb and min ST 18B (sqrt(10x30)=17.3, bumped one and given B since every depiction shows it braced on its own staff-mount or a Cryptek's stabilising legs rather than freely shouldered); RoF 1 and Shots 15(1800) (a half-hour recharge) reflect a genuine capacitor-class discharge. Bulk -7 and Rcl 1 fit a heavy staff-weapon; Acc 7, above the standard gauss/particle bracket, for a weapon built around precision penetration rather than raw saturation.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Necrons"
			],
			"tech_level": "12^",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "22000",
			"base_weight": "30 lb",
			"weapons": [
